A3 L2: on a quicktest map with FlowWorks, a 7 m pit with RM_PitGuardrail on one west lip and a bare west lip beside it, one hostile Pirate per lip: RM_FallRails.ProofWalkedStep reads the real per-move floor as door=rail (railed) and door=floor (unrailed: nobody walks off anyway), both prefixPass=False; a forced walked step over the railed lip is put back on the lip with no new descent, the same step over the bare lip (the control) falls (descents+1, Pirate in the pit)
